# This directory is both the live NewsletterFIT instance and the pad/ subtree of
# the instance repo, so this file decides what of it is git and what is runtime.
#
# Kept in git on purpose: data/outreach.db — the repo versions it as the off-box
# archive of the CRM and the mail log (Resend only keeps mail for 30 days). It
# shows as modified between archive refreshes; that is expected, not drift.
#
# Everything else here is either secret, runtime, or retired by the SQLite cutover.

# --- secrets ---
.env
leads/.env
.env.bak-*

# --- logs ---
*.log

# --- retired JSON stores (the SQLite cutover replaced these) ---
data/*.json
data/*.jsonl
data/*.pre-*
data/*-wal
data/*-shm

# --- lead-engine import fixtures ---
leads/data/*

# --- scratch / migration artefacts ---
attic/
node_modules/
__pycache__
*.pyc
